1
00:00:12,012 --> 00:00:15,473
<i>‎Kami ambil masa yang lama bersedia
‎dan berlatih untuk Pesta Kebudayaan.</i>

2
00:00:16,266 --> 00:00:18,767
<i>‎Kemudian, ia berakhir tanpa disedari.</i>

3
00:00:18,768 --> 00:00:20,894
‎Awak bawa permaidani itu balik?

4
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:22,730
‎Saya tak boleh bawa ia balik.

5
00:00:22,731 --> 00:00:24,691
<i>‎- Hari esoknya...</i>
‎- Membazir betul.

6
00:00:29,279 --> 00:00:32,699
{\an8}‎MOMOKA - HARI INI
‎LAMA KITA TAK BERHUBUNG

7
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,702
‎Maaf sebab tiba-tiba hubungi awak.

8
00:00:36,369 --> 00:00:38,705
‎Saya memang nak bercakap
‎dengan awak, Koyun.

9
00:00:40,957 --> 00:00:42,459
‎Ya. Samalah.

10
00:00:45,170 --> 00:00:46,296
‎Awak cakap dulu.

11
00:00:47,547 --> 00:00:49,548
‎Saya akan berterus terang.

12
00:00:49,549 --> 00:00:52,093
‎Saya nak awak jauhkan diri
‎daripada Minato.

13
00:02:26,604 --> 00:02:30,942
‎EPISOD 21
‎SALAH FAHAM

14
00:02:32,610 --> 00:02:36,447
<i>‎Aku dah lama sedar
‎yang aku ini selalu bercanggah.</i>

15
00:02:37,615 --> 00:02:40,409
<i>‎Aku asyik yakinkan diri
‎yang dia bukan ancaman,</i>

16
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:43,705
<i>‎tapi aku tak selesa dengan kehadirannya.</i>

17
00:02:44,789 --> 00:02:46,332
<i>‎Aku bencikan dia.</i>

18
00:02:47,375 --> 00:02:49,836
<i>‎Aku dah tanya. Banyak kali.</i>

19
00:02:50,712 --> 00:02:52,838
<i>‎Kalau dia betul-betul suka Minato,</i>

20
00:02:52,839 --> 00:02:55,091
<i>‎Koyun patut pertahankan dia
‎dan tak melepaskannya.</i>

21
00:02:56,301 --> 00:02:58,803
<i>‎Biadablah kalau nak dekati dia sekarang.</i>

22
00:02:59,304 --> 00:03:00,763
<i>‎- Teruknya...</i>
‎- Baiklah.

23
00:03:02,307 --> 00:03:04,017
{\an8}‎Saya takkan dekati Amamiya.

24
00:03:04,559 --> 00:03:05,642
‎MATSURI - GURU ONDO

25
00:03:05,643 --> 00:03:10,398
<i>‎Maksudnya, awak tak suka kami keluar
‎sebagai satu kumpulan, bukan?</i>

26
00:03:11,232 --> 00:03:14,736
‎Atau awak nak saya putuskan hubungan
‎dengan dia sepenuhnya?

27
00:03:15,695 --> 00:03:17,488
‎Saya...

28
00:03:18,156 --> 00:03:21,617
‎Kami masih perlu bercakap
‎sebab kami di kelas yang sama,

29
00:03:21,618 --> 00:03:23,286
‎jadi itu pasti sukar.

30
00:03:24,037 --> 00:03:26,330
‎Saya pun tak nak bersikap biadab.

31
00:03:26,331 --> 00:03:31,461
‎Tapi sama ada itu dianggap biadab
‎atau tidak bergantung pada kamu berdua.

32
00:03:32,086 --> 00:03:34,338
<i>‎Bergantung pada Minato?</i>

33
00:03:34,339 --> 00:03:39,260
<i>‎Kau cakap begitu sebab kau begitu pasti
‎yang dia akan memilih kau?</i>

34
00:03:39,969 --> 00:03:41,095
<i>‎Apa masalah dia?</i>

35
00:03:41,596 --> 00:03:43,765
<i>‎Dia berlagak macam ini hal remeh.</i>

36
00:03:45,058 --> 00:03:46,517
<i>‎Aku teman wanita Minato.</i>

37
00:03:47,310 --> 00:03:48,770
<i>‎Aku yang jadi penghalang dia.</i>

38
00:03:50,813 --> 00:03:53,775
‎Betulkah? Awak tak kisah buat begitu?

39
00:03:54,943 --> 00:03:57,695
‎Saya tahu awak selalu menafikannya,

40
00:03:58,529 --> 00:04:00,281
‎tapi awak suka Minato, bukan?

41
00:04:01,699 --> 00:04:06,246
‎Sama ada saya suka dia atau tidak,
‎itu tiada kaitan dengan hubungan kamu.

42
00:04:07,038 --> 00:04:08,790
‎Dia bercinta dengan awak.

43
00:04:09,499 --> 00:04:11,084
‎Dia pilih awak.

44
00:04:12,877 --> 00:04:16,005
‎Maaflah kalau tindakan saya
‎buat awak salah faham,

45
00:04:16,589 --> 00:04:21,051
{\an8}‎tapi sejak kamu berdua bercinta,

46
00:04:21,052 --> 00:04:24,806
{\an8}‎dia hanya anggap saya sebagai kawan.

47
00:04:25,473 --> 00:04:28,559
‎Saya percaya dia ikhlas dengan awak.

48
00:04:29,769 --> 00:04:33,147
<i>‎Saya dan Amamiya cuma kawan.</i>

49
00:04:34,315 --> 00:04:36,733
‎Kalau awak masih tak percayakan saya,

50
00:04:36,734 --> 00:04:40,154
‎saya akan jauhkan diri daripada dia
‎seberapa lama yang awak mahu.

51
00:04:41,614 --> 00:04:44,784
{\an8}‎Tolonglah percayakan Amamiya.

52
00:04:47,161 --> 00:04:48,663
<i>‎Kenapa?</i>

53
00:04:49,205 --> 00:04:52,541
{\an8}‎Saya tanya jika awak suka dia
‎dan awak tak nafikan.

54
00:04:52,542 --> 00:04:54,001
{\an8}‎Adakah itu jawapannya?

55
00:04:54,002 --> 00:04:55,252
‎TUNJUKKAN SESUATU, APA-APA SAJA

56
00:04:55,253 --> 00:04:56,336
‎AKU BOLEH NAMPAK KAU TAK GEMBIRA

57
00:04:56,337 --> 00:04:58,755
<i>‎Kenapa aku pula yang ditegur?</i>

58
00:04:58,756 --> 00:05:00,132
‎BERLAGAK SUCI
‎DIA YANG PALING BAGUS

59
00:05:00,133 --> 00:05:01,216
‎MEREKA PELBAGAI TEORI

60
00:05:01,217 --> 00:05:02,759
<i>‎Seolah-olah</i>

61
00:05:02,760 --> 00:05:04,345
<i>‎aku pula yang salah.</i>

62
00:05:06,264 --> 00:05:08,891
<i>‎Padahal aku yang datang
‎untuk akhiri semuanya.</i>

63
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:14,313
‎Baguslah awak boleh
‎bersikap rasional tentang hal ini.

64
00:05:14,314 --> 00:05:17,567
‎Setidaknya, awak sedar diri
‎untuk lupakan dia sebab dia dah berpunya.

65
00:05:18,151 --> 00:05:20,319
‎Memanglah kami bercinta,

66
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,071
‎tapi kami tak merancang
‎untuk berkahwin atau sebagainya.

67
00:05:23,072 --> 00:05:24,907
‎Semuanya cuma persetujuan lisan, betul?

68
00:05:25,408 --> 00:05:26,491
‎AKU CUMA GADIS YANG BERCINTA DENGAN DIA

69
00:05:26,492 --> 00:05:30,246
<i>‎Saya risau apabila kamu berdua bersama.</i>

70
00:05:30,913 --> 00:05:32,998
‎Sebab kalau saya di tempat awak,

71
00:05:32,999 --> 00:05:36,085
‎saya akan terus mencuba,
‎walaupun dia ada teman wanita.

72
00:05:36,669 --> 00:05:37,836
‎AKU BEGITU RISAU...

73
00:05:37,837 --> 00:05:40,590
<i>‎Saya takkan mengalah begitu saja.</i>

74
00:05:41,799 --> 00:05:45,177
<i>‎Aku tak nak orang
‎yang tak ambil kisah macam dia...</i>

75
00:05:45,178 --> 00:05:46,970
‎AKU SEMEMANGNYA

76
00:05:46,971 --> 00:05:48,055
‎LEBIH MENCINTAI DIA

77
00:05:48,056 --> 00:05:49,599
<i>‎...merampas Minato daripada aku.</i>

78
00:05:54,896 --> 00:05:56,647
‎Apa maksud awak "terus mencuba"?

79
00:05:57,982 --> 00:06:01,235
‎Saya akui keadaan jadi begini
‎sebab awak berusaha.

80
00:06:02,070 --> 00:06:06,448
‎Tapi "terus mencuba"
‎walaupun dia suka orang lain,

81
00:06:06,449 --> 00:06:07,867
‎itu pentingkan diri, bukan?

82
00:06:08,826 --> 00:06:13,163
‎Saya boleh yakinkan awak yang
‎saya takkan paksa dia balas perasaan saya.

83
00:06:13,164 --> 00:06:17,376
<i>‎Kalau asyik mengalah demi orang lain,
‎akhirnya kau yang rugi dalam hidup.</i>

84
00:06:18,002 --> 00:06:19,003
‎Tapi,

85
00:06:19,587 --> 00:06:22,006
‎rasanya pendapat saya tak penting pun.

86
00:06:23,299 --> 00:06:27,136
‎Bukannya kita perlu saling memahami.

87
00:06:28,221 --> 00:06:29,554
<i>‎Permusuhan.</i>

88
00:06:29,555 --> 00:06:34,559
{\an8}‎Awak mudah bergaul dengan orang lain.

89
00:06:34,560 --> 00:06:38,355
{\an8}‎Awak bina rangkaian kenalan
‎demi kepentingan sendiri.

90
00:06:38,356 --> 00:06:40,565
{\an8}‎Awak sentiasa yakin dengan diri sendiri.

91
00:06:40,566 --> 00:06:42,734
<i>‎Pedas sungguh kata-katanya.</i>

92
00:06:42,735 --> 00:06:44,194
<i>‎Dia cuba menyindir aku?</i>

93
00:06:44,195 --> 00:06:45,905
‎Saya ikhlas cakap begini,

94
00:06:46,781 --> 00:06:48,908
{\an8}‎tapi saya mencemburui awak.

95
00:06:50,159 --> 00:06:51,326
{\an8}‎Apa?

96
00:06:51,327 --> 00:06:53,745
‎Awak bertindak dan buat keputusan sendiri.

97
00:06:53,746 --> 00:06:56,124
‎Tentu awak miliki keyakinan yang tinggi.

98
00:06:56,791 --> 00:06:58,417
‎Awak sangat berbeza daripada saya.

99
00:06:59,502 --> 00:07:02,629
{\an8}‎Saya mencemburui awak, Momoka.

100
00:07:02,630 --> 00:07:05,508
{\an8}‎Awak mencemburui saya?

101
00:07:06,008 --> 00:07:08,302
‎Betul, saya mencemburui awak,

102
00:07:09,011 --> 00:07:12,223
‎tapi saya tak boleh
‎berkelakuan seperti awak.

103
00:07:13,057 --> 00:07:14,599
‎Kenapa tidak?

104
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:17,186
‎Saya rasa apabila bergaul dengan orang,

105
00:07:18,312 --> 00:07:20,313
{\an8}‎kita perlu tahu batas

106
00:07:20,314 --> 00:07:23,109
{\an8}‎antara orang yang kita nak kenal
‎dan sebaliknya.

107
00:07:24,026 --> 00:07:25,570
‎Betul juga.

108
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:29,240
‎Memang penat kalau perlu melayan
‎semua orang sama rata.

109
00:07:30,908 --> 00:07:32,743
‎Saya faham.

110
00:07:33,453 --> 00:07:34,579
‎Tapi...

111
00:07:35,621 --> 00:07:40,084
‎Momoka kerap bersama awak
‎sejak kebelakangan ini, betul?

112
00:07:40,793 --> 00:07:42,879
‎Dulu dia selalu bersama saya.

113
00:07:43,713 --> 00:07:46,424
‎Awak tahu sebabnya, bukan?

114
00:07:48,009 --> 00:07:50,094
{\an8}‎Jangan layan seseorang untuk manfaat saja.

115
00:07:50,761 --> 00:07:53,222
{\an8}‎Jangan jadikan orang sebagai alat.

116
00:07:53,973 --> 00:07:55,600
{\an8}‎Kenapa tiba-tiba cakap begitu?

117
00:07:56,267 --> 00:08:00,062
{\an8}‎Apa yang saya dah buat
‎sampai awak cakap begini?

118
00:08:00,980 --> 00:08:02,314
{\an8}‎Tiada apa-apa.

119
00:08:02,315 --> 00:08:04,358
{\an8}‎Awak tak perlu rasa apa-apa.

120
00:08:05,610 --> 00:08:10,865
<i>‎Tapi orang yang awak tak peduli,
‎yang awak anggap alat,</i>

121
00:08:11,657 --> 00:08:15,495
<i>‎mereka juga ada masalah dan boleh terluka.</i>

122
00:08:16,204 --> 00:08:17,914
<i>‎Mereka manusia biasa, seperti awak.</i>

123
00:08:19,290 --> 00:08:21,000
‎Awak boleh cuba nafikannya,

124
00:08:21,667 --> 00:08:24,253
‎tapi seseorang tahu
‎apabila mereka dipergunakan.

125
00:08:24,754 --> 00:08:26,005
‎Mereka akan terluka.

126
00:08:26,756 --> 00:08:28,256
{\an8}‎Tak peduli itu satu hal,

127
00:08:28,257 --> 00:08:30,218
{\an8}‎tapi jangan layan orang sesuka hati.

128
00:08:30,843 --> 00:08:32,261
{\an8}‎Itu saja

129
00:08:33,471 --> 00:08:35,389
{\an8}‎yang saya nak cakap hari ini.

130
00:08:42,855 --> 00:08:44,064
‎HEH

131
00:08:44,065 --> 00:08:46,608
‎Awak memang bencikan saya, ya?

132
00:08:46,609 --> 00:08:50,111
‎Ramai gadis tak suka saya,
‎jadi saya dah biasa.

133
00:08:50,112 --> 00:08:51,239
‎Tidak.

134
00:08:51,864 --> 00:08:54,367
‎Saya tak benci awak.

135
00:08:54,867 --> 00:09:00,206
‎Saya tak kenal sangat awak,
‎jadi macam mana nak benci awak?

136
00:09:01,123 --> 00:09:02,458
‎Begitu juga awak.

137
00:09:03,501 --> 00:09:09,006
‎Cuma saya tak setuju
‎dengan sesuatu yang awak buat.

138
00:09:10,383 --> 00:09:11,466
‎SENYUM

139
00:09:11,467 --> 00:09:12,802
‎Terima kasih sebab beritahu.

140
00:09:13,386 --> 00:09:19,308
‎Tapi bukankah kita sendiri
‎yang perlu berusaha untuk bahagia?

141
00:09:19,892 --> 00:09:22,519
‎Orang kata kita kena layan
‎semua orang dengan baik.

142
00:09:22,520 --> 00:09:25,272
‎Orang kata kita kena
‎fikirkan perasaan orang lain.

143
00:09:25,273 --> 00:09:27,942
‎Saya tak boleh buat begitu.

144
00:09:29,777 --> 00:09:31,112
‎Sebab saya pentingkan diri.

145
00:09:33,906 --> 00:09:35,950
{\an8}‎Saya pun tak boleh buat begitu.

146
00:09:36,534 --> 00:09:40,705
‎Tapi kalau kita asyik
‎pentingkan diri sendiri,

147
00:09:41,455 --> 00:09:44,083
‎akhirnya kita cuma
‎akan nampak kekurangan diri sendiri.

148
00:09:45,001 --> 00:09:47,503
‎Kesudahannya,
‎kita sendiri yang tak bahagia.

149
00:09:50,006 --> 00:09:52,800
‎Awak cakap tentang diri sendiri?

150
00:09:53,301 --> 00:09:55,136
‎Atau awak tujukan kepada saya?

151
00:09:56,304 --> 00:09:57,679
{\an8}‎Kedua-duanya.

152
00:09:57,680 --> 00:10:00,349
{\an8}‎Sebab itulah saya nak kamu berdua

153
00:10:00,850 --> 00:10:03,686
{\an8}‎rasa gembira dengan hubungan kamu.

154
00:10:05,605 --> 00:10:06,606
‎Jadi,

155
00:10:07,273 --> 00:10:08,691
{\an8}‎saya akan jauhkan diri.

156
00:10:09,692 --> 00:10:10,943
‎Awak okey dengan itu?

157
00:10:13,613 --> 00:10:14,614
{\an8}‎Ya.

158
00:10:18,242 --> 00:10:19,744
<i>‎Aku benci dia.</i>

159
00:10:21,245 --> 00:10:25,624
<i>‎Aku benci dia, semua yang dia buat,
‎malah kewujudannya sendiri,</i>

160
00:10:25,625 --> 00:10:27,877
<i>‎semuanya buat aku menyampah.</i>

161
00:10:29,545 --> 00:10:36,010
<i>‎Lebih baik dia terus terang saja
‎yang dia benci aku.</i>

162
00:10:37,011 --> 00:10:41,349
<i>‎Kalau dia memang musuh aku,
‎senanglah aku nak lawan dia dalam hati.</i>

163
00:10:42,391 --> 00:10:44,226
<i>‎Aku ada alasan yang kukuh.</i>

164
00:10:45,853 --> 00:10:47,688
<i>‎Aku menang tadi.</i>

165
00:10:48,689 --> 00:10:50,733
<i>‎Tapi kenapa aku rasa begitu kosong?</i>

166
00:10:53,611 --> 00:10:55,237
‎Saya asyik cakap begitu.

167
00:10:56,489 --> 00:10:58,574
‎Kemudian Hayato...

168
00:10:59,325 --> 00:11:01,243
‎MURAM

169
00:11:02,036 --> 00:11:03,037
‎Momoka?

170
00:11:06,082 --> 00:11:07,083
‎Kenapa?

171
00:11:12,004 --> 00:11:13,255
‎Minato.

172
00:11:14,048 --> 00:11:15,341
‎Awak suka saya?

173
00:11:18,677 --> 00:11:20,178
{\an8}‎Ya. Saya suka awak.

174
00:11:20,179 --> 00:11:21,222
{\an8}‎Apa yang awak suka?

175
00:11:22,348 --> 00:11:25,183
{\an8}‎Saya suka awak yang yakin,
‎berani dan bijak.

176
00:11:25,184 --> 00:11:28,521
{\an8}‎Itu macam pujian yang menyindir, betul?

177
00:11:29,313 --> 00:11:30,980
‎Macam saya ada helah.

178
00:11:30,981 --> 00:11:31,982
{\an8}‎AKU MEMANG BEGITU, TAPI...

179
00:11:33,484 --> 00:11:34,819
‎Tapi bagus juga begitu.

180
00:11:36,695 --> 00:11:37,696
‎Jadi...

181
00:11:38,239 --> 00:11:40,783
‎Siapa yang awak lebih suka?
‎Saya atau Koyun?

182
00:11:41,575 --> 00:11:43,953
{\an8}‎Kenapa awak tanya? Koyun kawan saya.

183
00:11:44,745 --> 00:11:46,621
{\an8}‎Dia macam Miki atau Yota.

184
00:11:46,622 --> 00:11:48,416
‎Itu "suka" yang berbeza.

185
00:11:48,999 --> 00:11:52,837
{\an8}‎Tapi kalau Koyun beritahu awak
‎yang dia sukakan awak?

186
00:11:53,504 --> 00:11:56,589
{\an8}‎Awak akan pilih dia, bukan?

187
00:11:56,590 --> 00:11:58,174
{\an8}‎Tidak.

188
00:11:58,175 --> 00:12:00,052
{\an8}‎Sebab saya bercinta dengan awak.

189
00:12:04,140 --> 00:12:06,058
<i>‎Sebab kami bercinta?</i>

190
00:12:06,934 --> 00:12:09,061
<i>‎Apa lagi yang tak cukup?</i>

191
00:12:09,854 --> 00:12:11,981
<i>‎Rasanya aku dah buat semua dengan betul,</i>

192
00:12:13,190 --> 00:12:15,358
<i>‎tapi aku masih dalam situasi yang sama.</i>

193
00:12:15,359 --> 00:12:16,569
‎BUATLAH
‎SAYA TAK KISAH

194
00:12:17,194 --> 00:12:18,863
<i>‎Kenapa dia masih risau?</i>

195
00:12:20,156 --> 00:12:21,615
{\an8}‎Maaf sebab buat awak risau.

196
00:12:22,283 --> 00:12:24,201
‎Apa yang saya buat untuk betulkannya?

197
00:12:24,994 --> 00:12:27,413
‎Apa yang awak nak saya buat?

198
00:12:29,123 --> 00:12:31,709
‎Boleh berhenti fikir logik
‎tentang hal ini?

199
00:12:32,293 --> 00:12:33,793
‎Ini soal perasaan.

200
00:12:33,794 --> 00:12:35,588
‎Perasaan siapa yang lebih penting.

201
00:12:39,425 --> 00:12:42,303
‎Okey, jauhkan diri daripada Koyun.

202
00:12:42,803 --> 00:12:46,222
‎Awak kata kamu cuma kawan,
‎tapi saya tak suka kamu terlalu rapat.

203
00:12:46,223 --> 00:12:48,517
‎Saya benci tengok kamu begitu serasi!

204
00:12:52,480 --> 00:12:53,481
‎Baiklah.

205
00:12:55,065 --> 00:12:57,443
‎Tapi sejauh mana yang awak maksudkan?

206
00:12:58,277 --> 00:13:01,280
‎Maksudnya, awak tak suka
‎kami melepak sebagai kawan, bukan?

207
00:13:01,822 --> 00:13:04,574
‎Atau awak nak saya putuskan hubungan
‎dengan dia sepenuhnya?

208
00:13:04,575 --> 00:13:08,286
{\an8}‎Kami masih perlu bercakap
‎sebab kami di kelas yang sama,

209
00:13:08,287 --> 00:13:10,038
{\an8}‎jadi itu pasti sukar.

210
00:13:10,039 --> 00:13:12,249
{\an8}‎DÉJÀ VU...

211
00:13:13,292 --> 00:13:15,251
‎Biar betul!

212
00:13:15,252 --> 00:13:17,755
‎- Biar betul!
‎- Kenapa?

213
00:13:23,761 --> 00:13:25,720
‎Ayah kata dia tak nak makan malam.

214
00:13:25,721 --> 00:13:27,556
‎Dia sepatutnya cakap lebih awal.

215
00:13:28,933 --> 00:13:31,644
‎Minato. Boleh tolong habiskan?

216
00:13:38,984 --> 00:13:40,277
‎Saya tak mampu habiskan.

217
00:13:41,529 --> 00:13:43,781
‎Biasanya kamu makan banyak.

218
00:13:44,823 --> 00:13:47,660
<i>‎Ada sesuatu yang tak kena...</i>

219
00:13:53,332 --> 00:13:54,416
<i>‎Aku tak tidur lena.</i>

220
00:13:57,461 --> 00:14:00,214
<i>‎Bercinta memang sukar.</i>

221
00:14:02,091 --> 00:14:04,467
{\an8}<i>‎Perasaan siapa yang lebih penting.</i>

222
00:14:04,468 --> 00:14:07,220
<i>‎Terima kasih kerana jadi kawan saya.</i>

223
00:14:07,221 --> 00:14:09,889
{\an8}<i>‎Semoga satu hari nanti,
‎awak akan mencintai seseorang...</i>

224
00:14:09,890 --> 00:14:13,434
<i>‎Saya nak tengok awak jatuh cinta.</i>

225
00:14:13,435 --> 00:14:14,436
<i>‎Tapi apa perasaan awak?</i>

226
00:14:23,821 --> 00:14:26,907
<i>‎Macam mana aku nak tidur?</i>

227
00:14:29,994 --> 00:14:31,077
‎KELETIHAN

228
00:14:31,078 --> 00:14:33,247
<i>‎Aku tak tidur langsung.</i>

229
00:14:33,831 --> 00:14:37,293
‎Minato. Kebelakangan ini,
‎kamu selalu mengetap gigi waktu malam.

230
00:14:38,002 --> 00:14:40,670
‎Mungkin kamu tertekan?

231
00:14:40,671 --> 00:14:41,672
‎Saya?

232
00:14:43,299 --> 00:14:46,009
‎Mungkin tak. Anak bongsu mak
‎tak pernah risaukan apa-apa.

233
00:14:46,010 --> 00:14:47,177
‎Ya.

234
00:14:47,928 --> 00:14:51,682
<i>‎Kebelakangan ini, aku rasa kurang sihat.</i>

235
00:14:52,349 --> 00:14:54,435
<i>‎Kepala aku terasa sangat tak selesa...</i>

236
00:14:56,270 --> 00:14:58,229
{\an8}‎Aduh...

237
00:14:58,230 --> 00:15:00,523
{\an8}‎- Kenapa?
‎- Saya tak...

238
00:15:00,524 --> 00:15:02,275
‎Minato?

239
00:15:02,276 --> 00:15:03,819
‎Sakitnya...

240
00:15:05,779 --> 00:15:07,322
‎Kamu tak apa-apa, Minato?

241
00:15:07,323 --> 00:15:08,699
‎Hei!

242
00:15:09,742 --> 00:15:11,076
{\an8}‎Awak tertekan.

243
00:15:12,036 --> 00:15:13,411
{\an8}‎Tertekan?

244
00:15:13,412 --> 00:15:16,874
‎Ya. Simptom setiap orang berbeza.

245
00:15:17,416 --> 00:15:22,630
‎Tekanan terkumpul sedikit demi sedikit
‎akibat perkara kecil yang tak disedari.

246
00:15:24,006 --> 00:15:27,383
‎Apa-apa pun, fikiran awak
‎dah terlalu penat sekarang.

247
00:15:27,384 --> 00:15:29,719
‎Saya akan beri ubat
‎dan pantau keadaan awak.

248
00:15:29,720 --> 00:15:34,474
‎Kalau masih tak bertambah baik,
‎dapatkan rawatan di klinik psikosomatik.

249
00:15:34,475 --> 00:15:36,143
<i>‎Klinik psikosomatik?</i>

250
00:15:36,769 --> 00:15:39,687
{\an8}‎Mujur saya tak ada kelas
‎sehingga tengah hari ini.

251
00:15:39,688 --> 00:15:41,023
{\an8}‎Ya.

252
00:15:41,607 --> 00:15:44,526
‎Jaga diri awak, Minato.

253
00:15:45,027 --> 00:15:46,028
‎Ya.

254
00:15:47,363 --> 00:15:49,615
<i>‎Saya tertekan? Sebab apa?</i>

255
00:15:50,616 --> 00:15:53,535
‎Alamak, brek tangan belum dilepaskan.

256
00:15:59,416 --> 00:16:03,045
{\an8}‎Dah sampai, tapi saya perlu letak kereta.
‎Saya boleh buat, bukan?

257
00:16:03,671 --> 00:16:05,965
‎Minato. Awak masuk dulu.

258
00:16:06,548 --> 00:16:07,549
‎Okey.

259
00:16:11,011 --> 00:16:13,180
{\an8}<i>‎Apa? Pintu tak berkunci?</i>

260
00:16:13,806 --> 00:16:14,932
<i>‎Kenapa terbuka?</i>

261
00:16:16,225 --> 00:16:17,393
{\an8}‎- Apa?
‎- Hoi!

262
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:21,772
‎Minato rupanya.

263
00:16:23,065 --> 00:16:24,441
{\an8}‎Abang!

264
00:16:28,529 --> 00:16:33,492
‎- Maaf sebab buat kamu terkejut.
‎- Kenapa awak masuk macam pencuri?

265
00:16:34,076 --> 00:16:36,369
‎Biadabnya. Ini rumah saya juga.

266
00:16:36,370 --> 00:16:40,915
‎Abang terkejut tengok saya tadi, bukan?

267
00:16:40,916 --> 00:16:42,543
{\an8}‎Ya, tentang itu...

268
00:16:43,419 --> 00:16:45,044
{\an8}‎Saya nak ambil cop rasmi.

269
00:16:45,045 --> 00:16:46,462
{\an8}‎Awak memang pencuri!

270
00:16:46,463 --> 00:16:49,800
‎Saya guna benda itu untuk buka akaun bank
‎semasa masih tinggal di sini.

271
00:16:50,843 --> 00:16:52,260
‎Apa-apalah.

272
00:16:52,261 --> 00:16:55,680
‎Saya nak pergi ke kolej.
‎Kamu buatlah hal sendiri.

273
00:16:55,681 --> 00:16:56,807
{\an8}‎Babai.

274
00:16:57,808 --> 00:17:01,394
{\an8}‎Minato tak sihat hari ini,
‎jadi jangan ganggu dia lama sangat.

275
00:17:01,395 --> 00:17:03,312
‎Apa? Dia tak sihat?

276
00:17:03,313 --> 00:17:05,024
‎Kami baru balik dari klinik.

277
00:17:05,566 --> 00:17:07,900
‎Tapi saya dah okey.

278
00:17:07,901 --> 00:17:08,902
{\an8}‎Jumpa lagi.

279
00:17:12,281 --> 00:17:13,824
{\an8}‎- Jumpa lagi.
‎- Ya.

280
00:17:16,535 --> 00:17:18,536
‎Peliknya nampak kamu tak bergaduh.

281
00:17:18,537 --> 00:17:19,788
‎Abang bukan budak kecil.

282
00:17:20,914 --> 00:17:23,541
{\an8}‎Tapi awak, Minato. Awak tak sihat?

283
00:17:23,542 --> 00:17:25,835
‎Tak, saya okey.

284
00:17:25,836 --> 00:17:28,672
‎Rasanya saya cuma penat.

285
00:17:29,465 --> 00:17:32,759
{\an8}‎Doktor kata jangan biarkan
‎tekanan terkumpul terlalu banyak.

286
00:17:32,760 --> 00:17:34,678
{\an8}‎Begitu...

287
00:17:35,512 --> 00:17:39,266
‎Awak memang begitu,
‎patutlah awak mudah tertekan.

288
00:17:40,601 --> 00:17:41,602
‎Dengar sini, Minato.

289
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:46,857
{\an8}‎Awak selalu ikut keadaan,
‎selepas itu pendam semuanya sendiri.

290
00:17:47,483 --> 00:17:51,987
{\an8}‎Awak tahan apa yang ingin diluahkan
‎dan memendam semuanya.

291
00:17:52,571 --> 00:17:54,030
{\an8}‎Awak selalu begitu.

292
00:17:54,031 --> 00:17:55,157
{\an8}‎Itu bukan...

293
00:17:55,783 --> 00:17:56,784
‎Abang minta maaf.

294
00:17:57,409 --> 00:18:02,247
‎Sebab awak selalu nampak abang
‎dimarahi teruk oleh mak dan ayah.

295
00:18:02,748 --> 00:18:04,833
‎Abang jadi contoh buruk untuk awak.

296
00:18:05,584 --> 00:18:09,128
<i>‎Awak nampak abang dipulaukan
‎sebab buat sesuka hati,</i>

297
00:18:09,129 --> 00:18:10,839
<i>‎tak hairanlah awak jadi begini.</i>

298
00:18:11,965 --> 00:18:15,094
<i>‎Awak seorang saja di rumah ini
‎yang menyebelahi abang</i>

299
00:18:15,677 --> 00:18:17,513
‎dan itu buat awak serba-salah.

300
00:18:18,680 --> 00:18:22,601
‎Abang buat awak melalui semua itu.
‎Maafkan abang.

301
00:18:23,811 --> 00:18:25,395
{\an8}‎Kenapa tiba-tiba cakap begitu?

302
00:18:26,814 --> 00:18:30,067
{\an8}‎Abang bukannya suka menilai orang lain.

303
00:18:30,567 --> 00:18:31,610
{\an8}‎Apa dia?

304
00:18:32,319 --> 00:18:36,697
{\an8}‎Ramai kawan abang terpaksa
‎berhenti kerja kerana tekanan.

305
00:18:36,698 --> 00:18:38,450
‎Sebab terlalu lama memendam tekanan.

306
00:18:39,243 --> 00:18:42,371
‎Tiba-tiba saja mereka tak tahan lagi
‎dan terus tumbang.

307
00:18:42,996 --> 00:18:44,581
{\an8}‎Abang tak nak awak jadi begitu.

308
00:18:45,958 --> 00:18:48,127
‎Saya masih lama lagi nak mula bekerja.

309
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:50,254
{\an8}‎Betul.

310
00:18:50,838 --> 00:18:55,509
‎Tapi orang dewasa
‎kena pandai membaca keadaan.

311
00:18:56,218 --> 00:18:58,469
‎Tapi apabila ramai orang berkumpul,

312
00:18:58,470 --> 00:19:01,849
‎bukan semua orang akan sependapat.

313
00:19:02,891 --> 00:19:03,892
‎Awak tahu kenapa?

314
00:19:04,726 --> 00:19:06,811
‎Sebab orang macam abang wujud.

315
00:19:06,812 --> 00:19:08,730
{\an8}‎TAK SUKA IKUT KELAZIMAN
‎JIWA PEMBERONTAK

316
00:19:10,315 --> 00:19:12,733
‎Abang boleh menyesuaikan diri di kedai?

317
00:19:12,734 --> 00:19:13,735
‎Biadabnya.

318
00:19:14,653 --> 00:19:17,488
{\an8}‎Setiap orang ada kegemaran
‎dan pendapat sendiri.

319
00:19:17,489 --> 00:19:21,075
{\an8}‎Kita kena ada pendirian
‎dan kenal diri sendiri.

320
00:19:21,076 --> 00:19:24,328
‎Awak kena tahu pendirian awak.

321
00:19:24,329 --> 00:19:27,832
‎- Ya?
‎- Ya dan sebab awak rasa begitu.

322
00:19:27,833 --> 00:19:31,920
{\an8}‎Awak takkan dapat kenal orang lain
‎selagi awak belum kenal diri sendiri.

323
00:19:34,131 --> 00:19:35,132
{\an8}‎Abang.

324
00:19:35,674 --> 00:19:37,925
‎Apa yang terjadi selepas abang keluar?

325
00:19:37,926 --> 00:19:40,179
‎Cukup untuk buat abang berubah.

326
00:19:40,679 --> 00:19:41,680
‎GAYA BERSAHAJA

327
00:19:42,222 --> 00:19:43,724
‎Teruskan bertahan, okey?

328
00:19:44,266 --> 00:19:46,852
‎Tapi tak elok cakap begitu
‎kepada orang yang tak sihat.

329
00:19:47,936 --> 00:19:49,145
‎Abang.

330
00:19:49,146 --> 00:19:50,355
‎Datanglah lagi, okey?

331
00:19:50,981 --> 00:19:52,106
‎Okey.

332
00:19:52,107 --> 00:19:54,401
‎Abang perlu pulangkan cop rasmi nanti.

333
00:19:55,068 --> 00:19:57,029
‎Bukan itu maksud saya.

334
00:19:59,948 --> 00:20:02,242
<i>‎Aku buat semua ini</i>

335
00:20:02,868 --> 00:20:05,287
<i>‎sebab tak nak jadi macam abang?</i>

336
00:20:06,997 --> 00:20:08,415
<i>‎Tidak.</i>

337
00:20:09,041 --> 00:20:13,170
<i>‎Aku tak faham
‎sebab mereka begitu bencikan dia.</i>

338
00:20:13,879 --> 00:20:15,672
<i>‎Aku cuma rasa takut.</i>

339
00:20:16,548 --> 00:20:20,593
<i>‎Ketika itu pun aku berasa tak selesa
‎apabila cuba menyesuaikan diri,</i>

340
00:20:20,594 --> 00:20:24,430
<i>‎jadi bukan sebab aku nak memberontak
‎atau membela mereka</i>

341
00:20:24,431 --> 00:20:27,184
<i>‎yang disalah anggap
‎atau terikut-ikut dengan orang lain.</i>

342
00:20:28,018 --> 00:20:31,188
<i>‎Aku cuma tak faham
‎sebab mereka begitu membenci orang lain.</i>

343
00:20:31,855 --> 00:20:34,774
<i>‎Ada yang menuding jari,
‎ada pula yang dituding jari.</i>

344
00:20:34,775 --> 00:20:36,610
<i>‎Sekarang, bukan aku yang jadi sasaran.</i>

345
00:20:37,319 --> 00:20:40,404
<i>‎Tapi keadaan boleh berubah bila-bila masa.</i>

346
00:20:40,405 --> 00:20:45,452
<i>‎Susah nak percaya seseorang
‎boleh jadi sasaran kebencian begitu besar.</i>

347
00:20:46,161 --> 00:20:51,123
<i>‎Aku takut orang akan membenci aku
‎kalau aku tersilap suatu hari nanti.</i>

348
00:20:51,124 --> 00:20:54,670
‎Kamu budak baik, Minato.
‎Tak macam abang kamu.

349
00:20:55,212 --> 00:20:58,715
<i>‎Macam mana kalau aku berbeza?</i>

350
00:21:00,050 --> 00:21:01,509
<i>‎Abang.</i>

351
00:21:01,510 --> 00:21:04,263
<i>‎Aku tak sebaik yang abang sangkakan.</i>

352
00:21:05,305 --> 00:21:07,349
<i>‎Aku tak ambil berat demi orang lain.</i>

353
00:21:07,891 --> 00:21:09,518
<i>‎Aku tak berbuat baik demi orang lain.</i>

354
00:21:10,310 --> 00:21:14,648
<i>‎Aku pilih tenang
‎sebab aku tak tahan tekanan.</i>

355
00:21:15,315 --> 00:21:17,817
<i>‎Aku bantu orang lain,</i>

356
00:21:17,818 --> 00:21:22,239
<i>‎sebab aku takut jika itu aku,
‎tiada sesiapa akan bantu aku.</i>

357
00:21:23,699 --> 00:21:25,659
<i>‎Aku tak boleh menolak seseorang</i>

358
00:21:26,326 --> 00:21:30,497
<i>‎sebab aku bayangkan perasaan
‎berada di tempat mereka.</i>

359
00:21:31,665 --> 00:21:34,042
<i>‎Aku memang tak baik.</i>

360
00:21:35,043 --> 00:21:38,922
<i>‎Aku cuma lemah dan takut keseorangan.</i>

361
00:21:40,090 --> 00:21:44,845
<i>‎Aku tak cukup percayakan sesiapa
‎untuk buka hati aku sepenuhnya.</i>

362
00:21:45,595 --> 00:21:49,766
<i>‎Bukan keluarga, kawan atau sesiapa saja.</i>

363
00:21:50,642 --> 00:21:53,811
‎Awak buat begitu
‎supaya orang pandang awak.

364
00:21:53,812 --> 00:21:55,856
‎Awak nak mereka bergantung pada awak.

365
00:21:57,441 --> 00:21:58,859
<i>‎Kenapa aku teringat itu pula?</i>

366
00:21:59,651 --> 00:22:03,238
<i>‎Aku ingatkan aku faham maksud dia,
‎tapi sekarang aku merasainya.</i>

367
00:22:04,823 --> 00:22:07,075
<i>‎Aku tak boleh terus begini.</i>

368
00:22:07,909 --> 00:22:11,038
<i>‎Nampak macam aku membuka hati,
‎tapi sebenarnya aku tak mampu.</i>

369
00:22:11,580 --> 00:22:13,206
<i>‎Aku menyakiti Momoka.</i>

370
00:22:14,416 --> 00:22:17,252
<i>‎Aku gunakan orang lain
‎untuk manfaat diri sendiri.</i>

371
00:22:18,754 --> 00:22:20,172
<i>‎Aku tak boleh</i>

372
00:22:21,173 --> 00:22:23,091
<i>‎teruskan hubungan dengan dia begini.</i>

373
00:23:50,929 --> 00:23:55,934
‎Terjemahan sari kata oleh Bibi Ellyvine

